@server_csharp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5170

### Health check
GET {{server_csharp_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### OCR (no translation)
POST {{server_csharp_HostAddress}}/ocr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "<base64-encoded-image>",
  "translate_engine": "none"
}

###

### OCR with local translation
POST {{server_csharp_HostAddress}}/ocr
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "image": "<base64-encoded-image>",
  "translate_engine": "local"
}

###

### Translate
POST {{server_csharp_HostAddress}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "食べる",
  "translate_engine": "local"
}

###

### Analyze
POST {{server_csharp_HostAddress}}/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "食べる",
  "sanitize": true,
  "mode": "local"
}

###
